rdware","Compatible MIDI monitor or reference source"],"severity":"major","pass":null}]},{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"allen-and-heath-xone-92","manufacturer":"Allen & Heath","model":"Xone:92","category":"mixer","summary":"Hardware diagnostic research profile. Candidate features: fader,eq,audio. Software: analog.","identityNotes":"Candidate hardware and software capabilities only; verify manual, revision, HID/MIDI transport, audio I/O, OS support and firmware on a physical unit. No claimed factory tolerances or MIDI identifiers. The added DIN-output evidence applies to legacy Xone:92 Mk1 in AP5345 Issue 4; it does not transfer Mk2, USB, firmware or host qualification.","documents":[{"title":"Manufacturer model feature reference","type":"support-article","url":"https://www.allen-heath.com/hardware/xone-series/xone92/","language":"en","notes":["The legacy Xone:92 and Xone:92 Mk2 have hardware differences. Check variant and do not inherit USB test methods."]},{"title":"Official manufacturer documentation or support entry","type":"manual","url":"https://www.allen-heath.com/hardware/xone-series/","language":"en","notes":"Navigate to exact model/revision if URL is not a direct manual."},{"title":"Driver and firmware support","type":"driver","url":"https://www.allen-heath.com/hardware/xone-series/","language":"en","notes":"Confirm OS-specific driver and version."},{"title":"Support and product help","type":"support-article","url":"https://www.allen-heath.com/hardware/xone-series/","language":"en"},{"title":"Service manual","type":"service-manual","url":"","notes":"Not found/verified as publicly available."},{"title":"MIDI/HID map","type":"midi-message-list","url":"","notes":"Exact implementation mapping not verified; use learn mode and capture."},{"title":"Xone:92 User Guide — AP5345 Issue 4 (legacy Mk1)","type":"user-manual","url":"https://www.allen-heath.com/content/uploads/2023/06/Xone92-User-Guide-Issue-4.pdf","language":"en","notes":"Checked 2026-11-18 UTC. Printed p.17 do