rit USB test methods."]},{"key":"verified_dual_analog_filters","label":"dual analog filters","value":2,"unit":"count","source":"https://www.allen-heath.com/hardware/xone-series/xone92/","confidence":"confirmed","notes":["The legacy Xone:92 and Xone:92 Mk2 have hardware differences. Check variant and do not inherit USB test methods."]},{"key":"verified_all_analog_signal_bus","label":"all analog signal bus","value":true,"unit":"bool","source":"https://www.allen-heath.com/hardware/xone-series/xone92/","confidence":"confirmed","notes":["The legacy Xone:92 and Xone:92 Mk2 have hardware differences. Check variant and do not inherit USB test methods."]},{"key":"verified_din_midi_output","label":"DIN MIDI output","value":true,"unit":"bool","source":"https://www.allen-heath.com/content/uploads/2023/06/Xone92-User-Guide-Issue-4.pdf","confidence":"confirmed","notes":"Legacy Mk1, AP5345 Issue 4, printed p.17: 5-pin DIN output. This confirms output availability, not a MIDI input, complete map or passed physical test."}],"midi":{"mapSource":"learn","complete":false,"controls":[]},"tests":[{"id":"allen-and-heath-xone-92-fader","category":"mixer","title":"Channel and crossfader sweep","why":"Test actual hardware response without inventing MIDI IDs, audio tolerances or HID mappings. Mixer fader must be measured through an analog/audio path unless the manufacturer explicitly publishes its MIDI mapping.","method":"manual:inspection","params":{},"steps":["Connect suitable known-good LINE level input (use PHONO only for true PHONO reference sources).","Sweep channel and crossfaders while metering/audio-capturing signal, including cut/bleed endpoints.","Compare left/right paths and record observed dropout/scratch/noise. MIDI may be captured separately only if documented."],"equipment":["Device","Compatible host or measurement interface as needed"],"severity":"major","pass":null},{"id":"allen-and-heath-xone-92-eq","category":"mixer","title":"Equalizer and gain sweep","why":"Test actual ha