model":"TRAKTOR KONTROL S4 MK3","category":"controller","summary":"controller profile with jog, motor, pad, fader, eq, audio, usb, display diagnostic groups. Companion workflow(s): Traktor Pro.","identityNotes":"Research seed; the exact S4 MK3 manual documents a built-in 24-bit audio interface and USB computer audio use. Its software version 3.2 (07/2019) is document provenance, not a firmware qualification. Numeric USB input/output counts and an enumerated hardware sample-rate list remain unresolved. DIN MIDI and exact control maps, USB IDs, class compliance, hardware revision, firmware, OS support and physical performance remain unverified; the current NI Windows 11 ASIO notice must be considered separately. MIDI-mode addendum (2026-11-20): NI states that controllers absent from its supported MIDI-mode table cannot switch to MIDI mode. The table lists S4 MK1/MK2 but not S4 MK3, so supported USB MIDI controller mode is false. DIN remains unresolved; no receiving port, identity response, complete map or current hardware/firmware qualification is inferred.","documents":[{"title":"Verified manufacturer capability reference","type":"support-article","url":"https://www.native-instruments.com/products/traktor-kontrol-s4","language":"en","notes":"Existing manufacturer capability reference from research pass 2. Checked 2026-11-18: this URL redirects to the generic DJ-controller collection. New exact-model audio evidence uses the pinned S4 MK3 manual below."},{"title":"TRAKTOR KONTROL S4 MK3 Manual, software 3.2 (07/2019)","type":"user-manual","url":"https://docs.native-instruments.com/pdf-guides/traktor/TRAKTOR_KONTROL_S4_MK3_Manual_English_0719.pdf","language":"en","notes":"Checked 2026-11-18. Printed p. 1 identifies S4 MK3 hardware and software 3.2 (07/2019); p. 2 specifies a built-in 24-bit/96 kHz interface. Section 4.1, p. 12, covers the USB computer link; section 10, p. 89, covers computer audio output/input. Numeric USB counts and a full supported-rate list are not established by these passages. The software/document version is not qualified firmware."},{"title":"Firmware, driver and downloads","type":"driver","url":"https://www.native-instruments.com/fileadmin/ni_media/downloads/manuals/traktor/TRAKTOR_KONTROL_S4_MK3_Manual_English_0719.pdf","language":"en","notes":"Check the model-specific download page and operating system."},{"title":"Kontrol S2/S4 MK3 ASIO driver block after Windows 11 update","type":"support-article","url":"https://support.native-instruments.com/support/solutions/articles/69000880969-kontrol-s2-s4-mk3-asio-driver-block-after-windows-11-update","language":"en","notes":"Checked 2026-11-18; no article revision date identified. NI describes a Windows 11 ASIO driver block and a WASAPI Exclusive alternative involving Traktor Pro 4.5. This is a compatibility notice, not qualification of a particular host, driver or firmware; existing compatibility fields remain unknown."},{"title":"Service manual (public availability not established)","type":"service-manual","url":"","notes":"Do not substitute operating instructions for a service manual."},{"title":"MIDI implementation chart (not verified)","type":"midi-message-list","url":"","notes":"Use MIDI Learn or the published mapping; HID events may not appear as MIDI."},{"title":"NI supported MIDI modes — S4 MK3 exclusion","type":"support-article","url":"https://support.native-instruments.com/support/solutions/articles/69000880031-native-instruments-switching-your-controller-to-midi-mode","language":"en","notes":"Checked 2026-11-20. NI explicitly says controllers absent from the table cannot switch to MIDI mode; the table lists S4 MK1/MK2 but not S4 MK3. The exact-model manual establishes the USB computer connection. This supports the absence of a supported USB MIDI controller mode, not an invented DIN value, receiving capability or physical-unit result. No article revision date is exposed."}],"connectivity":{"usb":{"present":true,"vendorId":null,"productIds":[],"classCo