nd effect selection, then return to bypass."],"equipment":["Device and known-good reference source"],"severity":"major","pass":null}]},{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"pioneer-dj-ddj-1000","manufacturer":"Pioneer DJ","model":"DDJ-1000","category":"controller","summary":"controller profile with jog, pad, fader, eq, audio, usb diagnostic groups. Companion workflow(s): rekordbox.","identityNotes":"Research seed; the manufacturer's DDJ-1000 Troubleshooting (Mac) article dated 2022-08-06 documents 12 input and 6 output USB audio channels in its Mac driver configuration, with MASTER/PHONES routing in rekordbox Performance mode. This source establishes audio capability; current OS/driver compatibility, hardware revision, firmware, USB IDs, class compliance, MIDI maps, sample rates, bit depth, full numbered channel maps and physical performance remain unverified. No factory tolerances or physical qualification are claimed. Transport addendum (2026-11-18): DDJ-1000 Operating Instructions DRI1516A, p. 31: USB carries control data to MIDI-compatible computer software. Set the utility for software other than rekordbox and configure the software MIDI settings. No message map or current platform qualification is imported.","documents":[{"title":"Manufacturer detailed product feature and specifications","type":"manual","url":"https://www.pioneerdj.com/en/product/dj-controllers/ddj-1000/","language":"en"},{"title":"Manufacturer manual/product documentation","type":"manual","url":"https://www.pioneerdj.com/en/support/","language":"en","notes":"Direct manual for some models; otherwise manufacturer's product/support landing page. Verify exact variant."},{"title":"Firmware, driver and downloads","type":"driver","url":"https://www.pioneerdj.com/en/support/","language":"en","notes":"Check the model-specific download page and operating system."},{"title":"DDJ-1000 Troubleshooting (Mac)","type":"support-article","url":"https://forums.pioneerdj.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022013031-DDJ-1000-Troubleshooting-Mac","language":"en","notes":"Manufacturer support article dated 2022-08-06; checked 2026-11-18. Exact DDJ-1000 Mac driver configuration: section 6 shows 12 input/6 output channels in Audio Devices; section 7 selects DDJ-1000 : MASTER and DDJ-1000 : PHONES in rekordbox Performance mode. These documented settings do not qualify another platform, driver version or physical unit."},{"title":"Service manual (public availability not established)","type":"service-manual","url":"","notes":"Do not substitute operating instructions for a service manual."},{"title":"MIDI implementation chart (not verified)","type":"midi-message-list","url":"","notes":"Use MIDI Learn or the published mapping; HID events may not appear as MIDI."},{"title":"Pioneer DJ DDJ-1000 Operating Instructions — DRI1516A (DDJ-1000 MIDI scope)","type":"user-manual","url":"https://downloads.support.alphatheta.com/manuals/dj-controllers/DDJ-1000/DDJ-1000_DRI1516A_manual.pdf","language":"en","notes":"Transport evidence only. DRI1516A; p. 31. DDJ-1000, excluding DDJ-1000SRT. Observe the utility and software MIDI settings; the previously documented Mac audio configuration keeps its original scope."}],"connectivity":{"usb":{"present":true,"vendorId":null,"productIds":[],"classCompliant":null},"midi":{"usbMidi":true,"din":null,"portNamePatterns":["DDJ-1000"]},"audio":{"usbChannelsIn":12,"usbChannelsOut":6,"sampleRatesHz":[],"bitDepth":null}},"software":[{"name":"rekordbox","role":"claimed companion / operating mode; verify model and version","minVersion":null}],"specs":[{"key":"candidate_capabilities","label":"Candidate hardware functions for diagnostic planning","value":"jog, pad, fader, eq, audio, usb","unit":"","source":"https://www.pioneerdj.com/en/support/","confidence":"unverified","notes":"These category-level capabilities require checking the exact hardware documentation."},{"key":"verified_channels","label":"channels","value":4,"unit":"count","source":"https://www.pioneerdj.com/en/product/dj-control